                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an educational game. If you know that, you'll probably really like it because it is a fun way to learn fractions in real problems and Native American history, while running around a virtual world jumping over snakes, spearing fish and canoeing through rapids. If you DIDN'T know it was an educational game, you might be annoyed, \"Hey, what is this video about the Ojibwe doing here?\"  You'll actually see how the Ojibwe lived by moving around in the woods, fishing, etc. in the game. If you haven't used fractions since middle school, this is a good brush up. If you are in middle school now, hey, you're in luck. I wish they had this when I was in school.",
